				"string" : "Barry continuity index: [[Barry workstream state]], [[Barry dated work records]]. Shared guidance: [[Catalyst working rules]] and [[Catalyst Fairy]]. The formerly linked Barry continuity contract page is missing (Barry page search found only these three pages); the dangling link is removed, not replaced by invented authority. Historical index described lifecycle facts only; maintained semantic state now also reaches instruction refresh, without execution resume or automatic acceptance verification."
